<style>
  /* the quick reference on /docs: boxes of a rule and a few lines each, set in
     columns, the headings as meta in the mono that lead to their pages */
  .cheatsheet :global(.container) {
    columns: 3 17rem;
    column-gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(.box) {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 2.25rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(h2),
  .cheatsheet :global(h3) {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font: 400 0.8125rem / 1.4 var(--face-mono);
    font-variant-ligatures: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    mask-image: none;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(h3) {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--quiet);
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(h2 a),
  .cheatsheet :global(h3 a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(h2 a:hover),
  .cheatsheet :global(h3 a:hover) {
    text-decoration: underline 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(p) {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(pre) {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(dl) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(dt) {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font: 400 0.875rem / 1.4 var(--face-mono);
    font-variant-ligatures: none;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(dt a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline 1px var(--quiet-line);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .cheatsheet :global(dd) {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--quiet);
  }
</style>

<div class="cheatsheet">

<div class="container">
  <div class="box install">
    <h2><a href="/docs/learn/quick-start#install-it">Install</a></h2>

Quick installation instructions.

```bash
npm i -D mdsvex@next
```

```bash
pnpm add -D mdsvex@next
```

  </div>
  <div class="box use">
    <h2><a href="/docs/learn/quick-start#use-it">Use</a></h2>

Add mdsvex to your Vite config

```js
plugins: [
  mdsvex(config),
  sveltekit()
]
```
  </div>
  <div class="box config">
    <h2><a href="/docs/reference/options">Configure</a></h2>

    <dl>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#extensions"><span>extensions</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>use custom extensions</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#frontmatter"><span>frontmatter</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>change frontmatter language</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#templates"><span>templates</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>wrap documents</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#select_template"><span>select_template</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>pick templates by path</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#components"><span>components</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>replace elements everywhere</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/reference/options#component_mode"><span>component_mode</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>replace typed html too</dd>
      <dt>
        <a href="/docs/plugins/writing/parse-plugins#parse_plugins"><span>parse_plugins</span></a>
      </dt>
      <dd>change the markdown tree</dd>
    </dl>

  </div>

  <div class="box layouts">
    <h2><a href="/docs/guides/templates">Templates</a></h2>

Wrap mdsvex documents in components.

<h3><a href="/docs/guides/templates#choosing-a-template">named templates</a></h3>

Pick a template by name.

```svx
---
template: blog
---
```

<h3><a href="/docs/guides/templates#opting-out">opting out</a></h3>

Render a document without one.

```svx
---
template: false
---
```

<h3><a href="/docs/guides/components">custom components</a></h3>

<p class="keep">Replace HTML elements with custom components.</p>

  </div>

  <div class="box frontmatter">
    <h2><a href="/docs/guides/frontmatter">Frontmatter</a></h2>

Frontmatter is exported as metadata.

```mdsvex
---
title: Fabuloso
---

# {metadata.title}
```

  </div>

  <div class="box integrations">
    <h2><a href="/docs/guides/directives">Directives</a></h2>
    <p class="keep">Markdown syntax for your own components</p>
  </div>
</div>

</div>
